Database updates for the sample app

From the project folder, apply all pending updates:

    uv run --extra gateway alembic upgrade head

Check the current database version:

    uv run --extra gateway alembic current

Run updates before starting the sample server. The database connection comes from
app/config.py and your SYNC_DATABASE_URL setting.

These files update the sample app's database. Apps using the SDK can use their own
database migration tool to manage their tables and the SDK tracking tables.
